        <briefdescription>
<para>Shows a modal glass dialog centred on <computeroutput>caller</computeroutput> with <computeroutput>content</computeroutput> inside. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Sets the given pixel <computeroutput>width</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>height</computeroutput> on the content, then creates the dialog window, centres it on <computeroutput>caller</computeroutput>, and enters modal state.</para>
<para>Ownership of <computeroutput>content</computeroutput> transfers to the dialog.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>caller</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The component to centre the dialog around. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>content</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The component to host; ownership is transferred. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>width</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_popup" kindref="compound">Popup</ref> width in logical pixels. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>height</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_popup" kindref="compound">Popup</ref> height in logical pixels. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
